   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Recognising counterfactual hypotheses in complex texts",
     "texto": [
      "Diplomatic dispatches and economic intelligence reports abound in sentences with past Konjunktiv II that evaluate alternative courses of action that never came to pass: **Hätte die Regierung früher eingegriffen, wären die Marktverzerrungen geringer geblieben** (If the government had intervened earlier, market distortions would have remained smaller). Identifying the unreal condition avoids confusing speculative retrospective assessments with consolidated historical facts."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Discursive indicators of unreality",
     "texto": [
      "Note the auxiliary pairs in Konjunktiv II (**hätte / wäre**), the word order with the verb in first position without a conjunction (**Hätte die Konferenz …**) or constructions with an unreal modal (**hätte verhindern können**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Textual structure",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Hermeneutic function",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Example in dispatches",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
